WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
I don't want your money anymore

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,100
If you don’t want money

3
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:08,920
I will feel very guilty

4
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,250
Then try another way

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:14,730
How can I repay the fare?

6
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,130
look at you

7
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:19,010
They must be tourists from all over the world.

8
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,380
what do you want to say

9
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,500
Well, since you are a tourist from all over the world

10
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,980
Then you should have been to many places

11
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,900
I learned a lot of stories, right?

12
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,000
So do you tell your story well?

13
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:43,150
should be compared

14
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:45,710
He's good at grabbing stories, right?

15
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:46,990
I can tell you

16
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:49,630
I've heard many stories too, I promise

17
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:52,830
No one has heard my story

18
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:54,910
That girl will believe you just once

19
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:57,310
If the story sounds good, I won’t charge you for the fare.

20
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:58,590
If it doesn't sound good

21
00:00:58,710 --> 00:00:59,990
See how this girl teaches you a lesson
